    "body": "Can you give a more complete scenario? Extract a MIME type should only be used where it is defined to be used. Note that for `sendBeacon()` for instance it uses the result of that operation as the input for the `Content-Type` header (though it forgets to serialize). That means it's safe.\r\n\r\nFor the `Blob` constructor however I would not expect that algorithm to be used. I would expect us to use the MIME type parser directly.",
